{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "01IZ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-reduced}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1163a80c53e5fdb6679bd931c820ad3a281762f3a7a7578df234123e16aa82d4", "source_text": "Reduced schemes", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ef8875394ed2ad22b61ae196ae13aa6a4957b0212980d64453f949a4024588da", "unit_id": "tag:01IZ:title"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "01IZ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X, x}$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-reduced}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:da45f22d100d2de66bdafcc2b93bdd60b3bd24445f3e310330c2fa9bcbac0b4a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:edbce9efc30cc80124d8988bfad72886bf9bc2d2a0123fa61909b1c9cc855b5f", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. We say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>reduced<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if every local ring\n<MATH_0003> is reduced.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2e7de5731c96e19f3a5d2177660541bfdcca283b96a102cbfb78897e1b4ee416", "unit_id": "tag:01J0:statement"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01IZ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}_X(U)$", "MATH_0003": "$U \\subset X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-reduced}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8cc2b48e0fc480aa8c59e39d078d9113b3952387b1ac71487c02a505e7578895", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:728255691346912de950c0b238e2f8f88bfe99b5948ea93864c003350e6d75bb", "source_text": "A scheme <MATH_0001> is reduced if and only if <MATH_0002>\nis a reduced ring for all <MATH_0003> open.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ace944b1837537883a622bd5247fe272dc54485388e50ec21ba6ad63e73e16ff", "unit_id": "tag:01J1:statement"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01IZ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$f \\in \\mathcal{O}_X(U)$", "MATH_0003": "$f^n = 0$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}_{U, u}$", "MATH_0006": "$u \\in U$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{O}_X(U)$", "MATH_0009": "$U$", "MATH_0010": "$f \\in \\mathcal{O}_{X, x}$", "MATH_0011": "$(U, f \\in \\mathcal{O}(U))$", "MATH_0012": "$f$", "MATH_0013": "$f$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X, x}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{sheaves-lemma-sheaf-subset-stalks}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:868f93d3fed818e0328b3768335b62bb7b888e3c46d20b73b72bbe158f238a33", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8a569148b8b8ee52d3ebb92517de92161e576c5051e9c3982c26fb19de7c2c53", "source_text": "Assume that <MATH_0001> is reduced.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a section such that <MATH_0003>.\nThen the image of <MATH_0004> in <MATH_0005> is zero for\nall <MATH_0006>. Hence <MATH_0007> is zero, see\nSheaves, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nConversely, assume that <MATH_0008> is reduced\nfor all opens <MATH_0009>. Pick any nonzero element <MATH_0010>.\nAny representative <MATH_0011>  of <MATH_0012> is nonzero and\nhence not nilpotent. Hence <MATH_0013> is not nilpotent in <MATH_0014>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:082ff5ae0d64139b9fae4bf87487dfc99dd935725ee24638d1894c8c1c557e37", "unit_id": "tag:01J1:proof"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01IZ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Spec(R)$", "MATH_0002": "$R$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-affine-reduced}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:72f2b0124eafdd1da09167458b55c534aba1cfa49c955d32132784a32416dd19", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ac19352130429fe07e7e238f5418fac74226b9eebb15df32453c73a0aa62f451", "source_text": "An affine scheme <MATH_0001> is reduced\nif and only if <MATH_0002> is reduced.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9c02edfab133a18f32d4aae266d4d3ffe4295cc8f9df98c1d82fa1a066dfc108", "unit_id": "tag:01J2:statement"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01IZ", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-reduced}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f3620388e1032f72a1dadb840d24f0a5ea2ab28e76fbf6c88f45f45d6cf15423", "source_text": "The direct implication follows immediately from\nLemma <REF_0001> above.\nIn the other direction it follows since any localization of\na reduced ring is reduced, and in particular the local rings\nof a reduced ring are reduced.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f163a905acc6709dbc77e036ae857932cab45b61099c8c80cbf64e4c7ab0df86", "unit_id": "tag:01J2:proof"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01IZ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$T \\subset X$", "MATH_0003": "$Z \\subset X$", "MATH_0004": "$Z$", "MATH_0005": "$T$", "MATH_0006": "$Z$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-reduced-closed-subscheme}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a51d909b040e9a37434293e77541d22607fe51183f3706731770d164d08d7fde", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e0779edcec551b69d01eee7cedaf1f85c304a9a45c767a278eace91d592b6dc4", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be a closed subset.\nThere exists a unique closed subscheme <MATH_0003> with\nthe following properties: (a) the underlying topological\nspace of <MATH_0004> is equal to <MATH_0005>, and (b) <MATH_0006> is reduced.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:991b1719806ddaeda726b6080492edd397694a3347c49f1fec911db29f502649", "unit_id": "tag:01J3:statement"}
